# 🚩 Challenge: [Ready Gladiator 1]
![alt text](gladiator1.png)
## 📝 Challenge Description
Can you make a CoreWars warrior that wins? Your opponent is the Imp. The source is available here
. If you wanted to pit the Imp against himself, you could download the Imp and connect to the CoreWars server like this:

nc chatelaine.cylabacademy.net 20433 < imp.red

To get the flag, you must beat the Imp at least once out of the many rounds.

Instance
Expires in 7:12
Hints
1. You may be able to find a viable warrior in beginner docs

### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget https://challenge-files.cylabacademy.net/library/0de30b210325e79eb6a36f28f93ad5c3a92bbc4ddff650dff94be88d7aeb196d/imp.red
2. nano imp.red

;redcode
;name Imp Killer
;assert 1

        ADD #4, 3
        MOV 2, @2
        JMP -2, 0
        DAT #0, #0

end
3. nc xebec.cylabacademy.net  20433< imp.red

```

